From a5175a1fdea3943a2dc9b8cf65aac219dfeb9e44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The browser Authors <noreply@browser.invalid>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:40:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 27/61] cancel-print-preview

--cancel-print-preview: a scripted print preview is closed unseen after a
short random delay, headed or headless, and the WebContents observer
gains DidRequestScriptedPrint so the Input action-outcome watch can
report it. The switch declaration rides in switch-resolver.
